# Secrets. .gitignore already excludes these, but .dockerignore is a SEPARATE
# file and the Dockerfile does `COPY . .` into the builder stage — without
# these lines `docker build` uploads the developer's real API key into the
# build context and leaves it in the builder layer (image cache,
# `--target go-builder`).
.env*
!.env.example

